    <entry_item>
      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>gedergüü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>гэдрэг</cyrillic>
      <transcript>GEDERGYY</transcript>
      <definition>[=gederge(n)] adv. Backwards, to the rear, back, in the opposite or reverse direction.</definition>
      <page>373</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ben xaraxu</transcript>
          <definition> To look back.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠪᠣᠯᠭᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bolγaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To place or push backward.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠪᠤᠴᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bucaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To return, come back.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠢᠶᠡᠨ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ijen jabuxu</transcript>
          <definition> To go back.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠲᠠᠲᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tataxu</transcript>
          <definition> To pull back.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠤᠷᠪᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- urbaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To turn back.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠤᠷᠤᠭᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- uruγu, </transcript>
          <definition>To and fro, forward and backward</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠠᠭ ᠭᠡᠳᠠᠷᠺᠥᠥ ᠡᠷᠭᠢᠭᠦᠯᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>caγ -- ergigylky</transcript>
          <definition> To set a clock or watch back.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Chinese</dico>
      <unicode>ᠭᠡᠳᠡᠷᠭᠦ</unicode>
      <cyrillic>гэдрэг</cyrillic>
      <definition>〔副〕向后，向相反方向，回转：гэдэргээ явах 向后走，回转；~ суух （马）猛力向后挣缰绳；~ харалгүй 不回顾， 一往直前；~ мултрах 〈医〉后脱位；~ түлхэлт 后冲步态；~ холбоо 〈电〉反馈，回授；~ холбож өсгөх 反馈计数放大；~ харан сэлэх 〈体〉仰泳；~ холбоо үүсэх нөхцөл 反馈条件；~ холбооны гажиг 回授畸变；~ холбооны хориул 回授抑止器；~ холбоотой хүлээн авуур 反馈无线电接收机；~ холбоотой чийдэн 反馈电子管；~т ландшафт 鼓丘景观.</definition>
      <page>347</page>
    </entry_item>
  </entries>
